  "description": "Non material amendment of planning permission ref. 23/AP/2124 (for the redevelopment of the Biscuit Factory and Campus Site).  The amendments include changes to Buildings 1-4 and 5 such as:\r- The office unit (Use Class B1) in the north-east corner of Building 1-4 to be changed to community/leisure use (Use Class D1/D2)\r- The office unit (Use Class B1) in Building 1-4 fronting Drummond Road to be changed to retail use (A1/A3/A4) or community/leisure use (D1/D2)\r- The retail unit (Use Class A1/A4) in the south-west corner of Building 1-4 to be changed to retail use (A1/A3/A4) or community/leisure use (D1/D2) \r- The retail unit (Use Class A1/A4) in Building 1-4 fronting Biscuit Walk to be changed to retail use (A1/A3/A4) or community/leisure use (D1/D2) \r- The community/leisure unit (Use Class D1/D2) in the north of Building 5 to be changed to retail use (Class A1/A3/A4)\r- The retail unit (Use Class A1/A4) and its refuse store in the south of Building 5 to be changed to a residents amenity space (Use Class C3)\r- Associated amendments to conditions to support these changes.",
